# PROBE 4's INSTRUMENT — a walk the COLLISION PROXY decides. Plan 22 `T1`.
#
# ⚠ `deck.keys` CANNOT ANSWER PROBE 4, and that is what this file is for. Asked
# whether the proxy is a cache, `deck.keys` says *rebuilding it every tick changes
# nothing* — and it says exactly the same when the proxy is built ONCE and never
# refreshed again, which is a sabotage that should have moved the world. Its walk
# meets nothing that blocks, so the instrument was blind to its own subject.
#
# Here the walk runs into a fence ring three hexes out, with levelling ON — so the
# ground carries where the walker STOPPED, and a proxy that cannot see the fence
# walks through it and stamps a longer pad.
rate 0
at 0 0 0
wait rebuilt
send 6:1
keys 1
step 90
keys 0
send 6:0
step 30
feet
save t1nofence
